        "id": 1334530
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-03-25T22:12:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sure, but regardless of what nonsense is in key, I don\u0027t believe there is a way to confuse this parameter. (I know. Never say never...)\n\nEx:\ndeclare -A ARR; key\u003d\"b ob]\"$\u0027\\n\u0027; ARR[$key]\u003djones; declare -p ARR",
      "parentUuid": "ec9b672d_bdf6ed88",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 69,
