        "id": 1314845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-03-25T21:32:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looks like the \"declare -A\" is unnecessary when you use \"ARRAY\u003d()\": https://tldp.org/LDP/Bash-Beginners-Guide/html/sect_10_02.html\n\n \n ARRAY\u003d() \u0026\u0026 declare -p ARRAY\n\nshows\n\n declare -a ARRAY\u003d()",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 140,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 140,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "a923fab22bcd080aeb3b9044f0dc55d886756f74",
