      "writtenOn": "2020-03-25T22:12:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, it would be implicit if I wanted a normal indexed array.\nCapital -A indicates you need it to be an associative array, which is different.\n\n\"ARR\u003d( ); ARR[bob]\u003djones;\" would result in \"declare -a ARR\u003d([0]\u003d\"jones\")\".",
      "parentUuid": "7d23ce3e_75fa6a98",
