      "message": "You can do the following to make it an array:\n\n    read -r -a ALL_BOARDS \u003c \u003c(basename -a board/*)\n    assoc-add-keys BOARDS_VALID \"${!BOARD_GROUPS[@]}\" \"${ALL_BOARDS[@]}\"",
      "parentUuid": "b0d63835_fb0c8aeb",
